}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"「旅籠」を取り巻く大河や、内部の水路に出没し、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"時に求められ、時に彼女の意志で、青年を「渡す」不思議な女。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"常に、割れた般若の面を被っている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"人の気分を察するのに長け、共にいることを苦にさせないタイプで、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"伝法な言葉使いをするが、口調自体は柔和で、人あしらいが良い。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"12329","sourceWorkId":"11114","spoiler":false}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/84/843b784871d5598d52db92c081264c02ddc8e01efdf7c771d68a71d32734e9b6.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/dc/dce7e311ccaa5df39a7070ecfca28f7423ebcbebaf15f14c4d2590000758fc11.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"歌織","creatorId":"vndb:s891","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s891","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s891","name":"富山 あかり","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:8074","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_c28042","characterName":"令嬢","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"57596","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"1013"}],"egsCharacterIds":["12326"],"vndbCharacterId":"c28042"},"originalCharacterName":"令嬢","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公・青年が泊まる「旅籠」の管理人一族の末裔。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"愛想のよい少女だが、自分を利用しようとする者たちを内心憎んでいる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"女としての憂き目に弄ばれているように見えて、逆にそれを利用する強かさ、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"そして、ギリギリの線での優しさ、高潔さを持っている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"一見、どれだけ犯されても傷ついていないように見えるが、本心は……？"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"12326","sourceWorkId":"11114","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"古い古い一族の令嬢。この旅籠宿の管理人一族の末裔。割合愛想もいいが、自分に言い寄り利用しようとする者たちに内心で怒りを燃やしている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"女としての憂き目に弄ばれるようにみえて、それを利用するだけのしたたかさを持つ。なおかつ、それでも最後の優しさ、高潔さだけは失わない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"どれだけ犯しても傷つかないように見えて、実はぼろぼろ。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"57596"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/8c/8c8f3d56359e3bbb4327b45562f00dcb2f69f489c62ce4005ab584e6c7397e2c.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/1a/1adfabe06efab44430479418a394751ea2d4e62be9bd6ecc61a6457a1bf040e1.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"天水るみ","creatorId":"vndb:s2561","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s2561","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s2561","name":"天水 るみ","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:1013:57596:28735:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c28043","characterName":"司書","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[],"egsCharacterIds":["12327"],"vndbCharacterId":"c28043"},"originalCharacterName":"司書","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"「旅籠」にある寂れた図書室で、勝手に司書をしている女性。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「人を喰らう」「若い男が好物」など、様々な噂がある鬼女で、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"淑やかな美女風であるにも関わらず、あまり人が寄り付かない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"空腹を紛らわすべく、いつも図書館で読書に耽っているため、知識は豊富。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"左腕の肘から少し先より、常に少量の血を滲ませているようだが……？"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"12327","sourceWorkId":"11114","spoiler":false}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/3d/3daa91b3a9273168cc7642114d69e1e7cc196f9a47313a6e19b639203225643f.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/fd/fd2d312c146bcb739fc78d70020cedf18e874e748511a24c1e263fe3d83f4130.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"香澄 りょう","creatorId":"vndb:s29","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s29","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s29","name":"高城 みつ","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:8072","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_c28044","characterName":"法師","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"57598","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"1013"}],"egsCharacterIds":["12328"],"vndbCharacterId":"c28044"},"originalCharacterName":"法師","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"「旅籠」内の温室によく現れる、琵琶法師の少女。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"愚鈍と取られかねないほど浮世離れしているが、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"琵琶の演奏だけは神の領域。本人も、琵琶さえ弾ければ満足らしい。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"常に緩んだ衣装を身に纏い、優しく穏やかなタイプだが、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"琵琶の曲を追い求める時だけは、物狂おしい様相を見せる。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"12328","sourceWorkId":"11114","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"旅籠の中の温室によく現れる。それ以外の時はどこでなにをしているか不明。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"なにやら浮世離れしており、一見すると愚鈍とも取られかねないが、琵琶を弾くことだけは神域に達している。本人も琵琶を弾いてさえいれば満足。常に緩んだ表情をしており基本的に優しいのだが、琵琶の曲を追い求める時だけは人が変わって、物狂おしい様相を見せたりもする。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"57598"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/5c/5c97d8ec2c1f4781396bb30c7ec2c8d242f6dc10c98f0049b7052ccfc01e88e4.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/87/876872581741d77274f9dbcc4a929b9c2c846183ac396aa422873e6c56b0be66.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"愛原 瑞生","creatorId":"vndb:s2982","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s2982","canon